This folder contains four Jupyter notebooks for predicting chlorinated PAHs (ClPAHs) in ambient air, split into gas-phase and particle-phase.

ClPAHs_Gas_Phase_Prediction.ipynb — gas-phase prediction (two-stage XGBoost).
SHAP_ClPAHs_Gas.ipynb — SHAP interpretation of the gas-phase model.
ClPAHs_Particle_Phase_Prediction.ipynb — particle-phase prediction.
SHAP_ClPAHs_Particle.ipynb — SHAP interpretation of the particle-phase model.
